.md
## Webcam Heightfield: 90s Retro Future
Turn a live webcam feed into a glowing 3D point field: each pixel's brightness becomes height, creating a retro-futuristic effect inspired by 90s computer-graphics scenes.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Webcam Heightfield: 90s Retro Future
Turn a live webcam feed into a glowing 3D point field: each pixel's brightness becomes height, creating a retro-futuristic effect inspired by 90s computer-graphics scenes.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Open the default webcam and use it as the live video source.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Open the default webcam and use it as the live video source.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
cam = DeviceOpen["Camera"];
cam["FrameRate"] = 60;
cam 

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Capture each frame as quickly as possible, convert it to grayscale, and map brightness values to 3D vertex heights with low-level `GraphicsComplex`.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Capture each frame as quickly as possible, convert it to grayscale, and map brightness values to 3D vertex heights with low-level `GraphicsComplex`.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Refresh[Module[{img, length},
  img = ImageData[
    ImageResize[ColorConvert[DeviceRead[cam], "GrayScale"], 100],
    "Real32"
  ];
  length = Length[img] Length[img[[1]]];
  vertices = MapIndexed[Join[#2, {50.0 #1}]&, img, {2}];
  vertices = Flatten[vertices, 1];

  Graphics3D[GraphicsComplex[vertices, {
    Red, PointSize[0.0003],
    Point[Range[length]]
  }], ViewProjection->"Perspective", ImageSize->Medium]
], 1/60.0]

%------------------------------%EndOfCells%-------------------------------%



